{"articleNo":"147443","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=147443&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"사과문","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.03.05","hit":"5191","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 32pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">사 과 문</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 먼저 지난 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">25</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일 본교 신입생 오리엔테이션 중 발생한 불미스러운 사건에 대하여 신입생 및 학부모님과 학생 여러분께 진심으로 사과 말씀을 드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 미래의 희망을 안고 대학에 첫 발을 내딛은 신입생 여러분과 재학생들이 받았을 상처와 상실감에 책임을 통감합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 인성과 지성의 전당으로 인재 양성을 위한 대학 본연의 역할에 최선을 다할 것을 약속드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이유여하를 떠나 이번에 발생된 사건의 경위를 철저하게 밝혀 다시는 이 같은 불미스런 일이 발생 하지 않도록 재발 방지에 최선을 다하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 이에 우리 대학은 올바른 캠퍼스 문화를 조성하고 건전한 학생 문화를 정착 시킬 수 있도록 철저한 진상조사와 함께 아래와 같이 조치를 취하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 첫째</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">진상규명조사위원회를 구성하여 사건의 진상을 명확히 밝혀 관련 대상자들을 엄벌 조처하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">현재 대학본부는 관련 대상자들을 대상으로 진상 조사를 벌이고 있으며 한 치의 의혹이 없이 사건을 규명하여 학생과 학부모 여러분의 신뢰를 회복하는데 최선을 다하겠습니다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 둘째</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신입생 오리엔테이션을 비롯한 학생회 주관의 모든 교내외 행사를 제한하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">철저하게 감독하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">앞으로 총학생회 및 학부</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">단위의 각종 행사의 취지와 목적을 규정하고 이를 준수하여 건전한 대학문화를 정착시킬 수 있도록 전담 관리를 실시하여 재발 방지에 만전을 기하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 셋째</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">인성 교육과 성희롱</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">성폭력 예방교육을 확대 강화하여 재발 방지에 최선을 다하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">배려하고 소통하는 캠퍼스 문화를 정착시키도록 교육과정을 강화하는 한편</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, ‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생상담센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">의 기능을 보다 강화하여 운영하겠습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; 다시 한 번 신입생 여러분과 재학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학부모 여러분께 심려를 끼친 데 대해 진심으로 죄송하다는 말씀을 드리며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">본교는 앞으로 학생자치 활동을 비롯한 동아리 활동 등 대학문화 전반에 대한 철저한 점검을 실시하여 건전한 캠퍼스 문화를 정착시킬 수 있도록 최선을 다할 것을 약속드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서\">2016</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Gungsuh,궁서; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월 </spa